### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"me@test.com","password":"123456"}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"me@test.com","password":"123456"}

### Create task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{"title":"Finish CV","due_date":"2026-10-30"}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?status=done
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{"status":"done"}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### No token (should fail with 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks